mapping "W1963.1" source="W1963" target="1912002" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target quality=100 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W1963 SNOMED CT 1912002 = Unspecified fall at industrial/construction site during other
        activity. Swedish national 6-char extension of W19 (Unspecified fall). Target SNOMED CT 436583
        (concept_code 1912002) is the standard concept that the parent W19 maps to via Athena crosswalk.
        No standard SNOMED CT concept exists for the place/activity subdivision, so is the best available
        standard target and legitimately subsumes every more-granular W19 extension (every
        fall-at-industrial-site is a Fall). Broader (one logical level), parent crosswalk-verified,
        well-understood breadth mismatch.
        """
}
